      <p><seg source="#source-498-620">石田及下等士官水夫頭には、私より金少々遣し申候。弐拾金御つかはしになれば可なり。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-620-695">西洋衣がとゝのい申候。彼横笛船では船将にて候得バ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-695-716"><rb>夫</rb><rt>（それ）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-716-749">ばかりの事してやり度奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-749-761">レ</note><seg source="#source-761-785">存候。何れ御考奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-785-797">レ</note><seg source="#source-797-817">願候。再拝。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-817-905" style="padding-inline-start: 3em">
        <p><seg source="#source-838-853">八月廿五日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-853-905" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(1)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=1"><seg source="#source-883-905">龍馬　再拝。</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-905-943" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
        <p><seg source="#source-926-943">佐々木先生</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-943-970" style="padding-inline-start: 9em">
        <p><seg source="#source-964-970">左右</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
